{"id":"vod_bf_14","vodId":"14","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"3月的狮子第一季","name_cn":"3月的狮子第一季","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第23集","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-1/20193d5e8b7ea6f7abf7a874f5976e89.jpg"},"summary":"十七岁的桐山零（河西健吾 配音）是一名将棋棋士，悲惨的童年遭遇让他自幼便失去了家人，这么多年来一直背负着沉重的记忆独自生活，长此以往，零已经习惯了压抑自己的感情，在心房周围筑起了无法撼动的高墙。某日，零邂逅了川本家的三姐妹——温柔体贴，擅长照顾他人的大姐川本明里（茅野爱衣 配音）、个性开朗乐观，非常不擅长料理家事的二姐川本日向（花泽香菜 配音）和还在上托儿所稚气未脱的小妹川本桃（久野美咲 配音）。三姐妹的出现让零再度感受到了家的温暖，找回了久违的快乐。与此同时，二海堂晴信（冈本信彦 配音）、三角龙雪（杉田智和 配音）和松本一砂（本村昂 配音）等强劲对手的出现，亦令零燃起了对将棋的热爱于斗志。©豆瓣","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 18:27:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":23,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/3yuedeshizidiyiji/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name"